[00:20.14] Now that I've made up my mind you're gone it should be easier now
[00:33.82] Perhaps now my heart will stop hanging on it should be easier now
[00:51.94] The lesson I've learned from you gold can't buy
[01:01.12] A heart can be broken and still survive
[01:10.36] Thanks to you now a much wiser man am I and it should be easier now
[01:37.58] [ Ac.guitar ]
[01:43.64] The worst now is over I've stood the test it should be easier now
[02:00.92] They say everything happens for the best it should be easier now
[02:17.94] The wounds in my heart you've carved deep and wide
[02:30.54] Hollowed and washed with the tears I've cried
